      "text": "p1 = head\np2 = secHead\nwhile(p1 != nullptr) {\n    tmp1 = p1 -> next\n    tmp2 = p2 -> next\n    p1 -> next = p2\n    p2 -> next = tmp1\n    p1 = tmp1\n    p2 = tmp2\n}",
